  "question": {
    "text": "If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "11",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>7</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Putting&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;limit we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced><mfrac><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>For limit to exist&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;should be zero</p><p>so <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Now Using L-Hospital in equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Again putting&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Again for limit to exist&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p>So from equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>So <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math></p>"
  }
